{"id":"semantic-recall-parked","parent":"sd-search","ord":"a1","title":"Semantic recall — built, reviewed, parked (draft PR #165)","todo":true,"desc":"- Parked 2026-08-14 at the human's word with the pipeline complete: reviewed, CI green, local llama-cpp + bge-small embedder (~3ms warm queries). Design doc: docs/brainstorming/semantic-recall.md.\n- To resume:\n  - Merge master and re-fit to the moved search seam (#167, #168).\n  - Apply the two ratified re-fit obligations: declare `matched: \"meaning\"` on the format floor; feed the parsed filter (not raw operator text) to the recall leg.\n  - Re-run CI and field for approval.","changed":"2026-08-22T13:12:41-04:00"}
{"id":"reminders-notifications","parent":"sd-dates","ord":"a0","title":"Reminders: nothing ever alerts you about due work #needs-brainstorm","todo":true,"desc":"- Repeats and the agenda exist, but nothing notifies — no reminders, no due alerts, anywhere.\n- To decide in a brainstorm: the channel (browser notifications, the chat agent speaking up, OS-level), and the trigger (a date arriving, a repeat coming due, the agenda going non-empty).\n- Or rule that olai is deliberately pull-only — and write that down, since today the absence is stated nowhere.","created":"2026-08-20T17:40:46-04:00","changed":"2026-08-22T13:12:41-04:00","custom":{"from":"repo survey 2026-08-20 (Opus explore agent), on the human's ask"}}
